     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Thiago,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m still a bit confused about this description. If these items are to be considered separately, where are the other 27 items in your model? Also, in order to make this model identified you would need to constrain the slopes to be equal to a constant (say 1; see ?mirt.model for the START and FIXED arguments), and even then it may not be empirically identified due to the correlation estimates.   </div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Phil</span><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
